<title>NETHERLANDS: Nutricia in jobs deal with Adecco.</title>
<headline>Nutricia in jobs deal with Adecco.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foods group Nutricia NV said on Thursday it had signed a five-year contract with job recruitment group Adecco giving it exclusive rights to supply temporary staff for Nutricia's Dutch locations.</p>
<p>Nutricia previously used the services of five different temporary employment agencies throughout the country.</p>
<p>Under the deal, Adecco has undertaken to employ any Nutricia workers who are made redundant for a three-year period with the aim of securing them a permanent job elsewhere.</p>
<p>A Nutricia spokesman said the company might employ an average of 50-100 temporary staff a year at its Dutch units.</p>
<p>The deal was not quantifiable in cash terms, he added.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
